BT /F2 16 Tf 54 723 Td (Lumen LF-60P Installation Manual) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 701 Td (Document ID: prod-lf60p-installation-manual | Version: 1 | Effective: 2025-03-17 | Owner: Lumen) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 688 Td (Engineering, Rotterdam | Applies to firmware: 1.9.0) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 663 Td (1. About this manual) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 641 Td (This manual describes how to install, wire, ground, bolt and commission the Lumen LF-60P) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 628 Td (optical flow meter. It applies to all LF-60P meters from DN25 to DN150 with PN40 flanges,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 615 Td (including the Hastelloy C-276 variants ordered with the -HC suffix. It is written for qualified) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 602 Td (mechanical and instrumentation technicians working on pressurised pipework.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 580 Td (The LF-60P shares its measuring principle and much of its installation procedure with the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 567 Td (standard-pressure LF-60. Do not use the LF-60 Installation Manual for an LF-60P: straight-run) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 554 Td (lengths, bolt torques, cable requirements and commissioning steps differ. The installation) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 541 Td (manual revision that applies to your meter is printed on the label inside the terminal) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 528 Td (compartment cover.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 506 Td (Throughout this manual, menu paths on the local display are written with the greater-than sign) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 493 Td (between levels, for example Menu > Setup > Outputs. Terminal numbers refer to the terminal) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 480 Td (block inside the rear compartment of the electronics housing.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54 457 Td (1.1 Related documents) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 435 Td (- Lumen LF-60P Optical Flow Meter Datasheet \(prod-lf60p-datasheet\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 422 Td (- Lumen Modbus Register Map \(prod-lumen-modbus-register-map\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 409 Td (- Lumen Error Code Reference \(sup-lumen-error-codes\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 396 Td (- Lumen Firmware 1.9.0 Release Notes \(prod-lumen-firmware-1-9-0-release-notes\)) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 380 Td (2. Safety) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 358 Td (The LF-60P is a pressure-retaining component. Installation and removal must only be carried out) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 345 Td (when the pipe section has been isolated, depressurised, drained and, where the fluid is hot,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 332 Td (cooled to below 40 \260C. Never loosen flange bolts or the pressure sensor fitting on a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 319 Td (pressurised line.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 297 Td (- Follow the site permit-to-work system and lock-out/tag-out rules before starting.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 284 Td (- Wear eye protection when handling the meter; the sapphire windows are recessed but the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 271 Td (   measuring tube edges are sharp.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 258 Td (- The meter weighs 9.8 kg at DN50 and up to 38 kg at DN150. Use lifting straps around the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 245 Td (   meter body, never around the electronics housing or cable glands.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 232 Td (- The LF-60P is not certified for hazardous areas. Do not install it in a location) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 219 Td (   classified as Zone 0, 1 or 2.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 206 Td (- The 24 VDC supply must be a SELV/PELV source with a current limit not exceeding 2 A.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 190 Td (3. Product identification) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 168 Td (Each meter carries two labels. The nameplate on the measuring tube shows the order code, serial) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 155 Td (number, nominal size, pressure rating, maximum fluid temperature and wetted material. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 142 Td (electronics label on the housing shows the power requirement, firmware version at the time of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 129 Td (shipment and HART device revision.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 107 Td (Order codes follow the pattern LF60P-{size}-PN40 with an optional -HC suffix. The serial number) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 94 Td (format is LP followed by two digits for the year and six digits, for example LP25-004127. Quote) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 81 Td (the serial number whenever you contact Meridian support.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 59 Td (Check that the pressure rating on the nameplate \(PN40, 40 bar\) is equal to or greater than the) Tj ET
endstream
