stream
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 729 Td (design pressure of the line, and that the maximum fluid temperature \(+120 \260C\) will not be) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 716 Td (exceeded.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 691 Td (4. Unpacking and inspection) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 669 Td (Each LF-60P is shipped in a foam-lined carton with the following items:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 647 Td (- LF-60P meter with protective flange covers fitted) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 634 Td (- Two M20 x 1.5 nickel-plated brass cable glands \(fitted\) and one M20 blanking plug) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 621 Td (- Terminal compartment key \(4 mm hex\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 608 Td (- Printed quick reference card and calibration certificate) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 595 Td (- For -HC variants only: FKM spare seal set, part LF-SEAL-P-FKM) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 582 Td (Keep the flange covers in place until the meter is lifted into position. They protect the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 569 Td (sapphire windows from dust and knocks. Inspect the windows through the bore before) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 556 Td (installation: they must be clear, undamaged and free from fingerprints. Clean only with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 543 Td (isopropyl alcohol and a lint-free cloth.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 521 Td (Store unused meters indoors between -40 and +70 \260C in their original packaging.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 496 Td (5. Site selection) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 474 Td (The LF-60P measures accurately only when the pipe is full and the flow profile is well) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 461 Td (developed. Choose a location that meets all of the following conditions:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 439 Td (- At least 15 pipe diameters \(15D\) of straight pipe of the same nominal size upstream of the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 426 Td (   meter.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 413 Td (- At least 5 pipe diameters \(5D\) of straight pipe downstream.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 400 Td (- Where the upstream disturbance is a control valve, a partially open butterfly valve or two) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 387 Td (   elbows in different planes, increase the upstream length to 25D or install a flow) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 374 Td (   conditioner.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 361 Td (- The meter must not be at the highest point of the line, where air collects.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 348 Td (- Avoid installing immediately downstream of a pump discharge; allow at least 20D.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 335 Td (- Ambient temperature at the electronics must stay between -40 and +60 \260C. Fit a sunshade) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 322 Td (   where the housing is exposed to direct sun in hot climates.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 309 Td (The IP67 rating allows installation in valve chambers and pits that may flood temporarily, up) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 296 Td (to 1 m of water for 30 minutes. Where prolonged submersion is likely, use the remote-mount) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 283 Td (electronics kit LF-RMK-10, which allows the electronics to be mounted up to 10 m away.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 258 Td (6. Pipe preparation) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 236 Td (Before fitting the meter, flush the line to remove welding slag, scale and debris. Particles) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 223 Td (larger than 2 mm can scratch the sapphire windows.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 201 Td (Check that the mating flanges are EN 1092-1 PN40 \(or ASME Class 300 for meters ordered with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 188 Td (ASME flanges\), that they are parallel within 0.5 mm across the flange face and that the bolt) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 175 Td (holes are aligned. Do not use the meter to pull misaligned pipework into position.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 153 Td (The gap between the mating flanges must equal the meter face-to-face length plus the thickness) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 140 Td (of two gaskets. Face-to-face lengths are 200 mm for DN25 to DN50, 250 mm for DN65 to DN100 and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 127 Td (300 mm for DN125 and DN150.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 102 Td (7. Mechanical installation and orientation) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 80 Td (The arrow on the meter body shows the forward flow direction. The meter measures reverse flow) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 67 Td (as well, but accuracy is specified in the forward direction only.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
