stream
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 729 Td (the LF-60P. The receivers and the high-speed correlation electronics are sensitive to potential) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 716 Td (differences between the fluid and the meter body.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54 693 Td (9.1 Metallic, unlined pipe) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 671 Td (On bare carbon steel or stainless steel pipe, connect the grounding lug on each flange of the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 658 Td (meter to the mating pipe flange with the supplied 6 mm\262 braided straps, and connect terminal 9) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 645 Td (to the plant functional earth. The resistance between the meter body and the plant earth must) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 632 Td (be less than 1 ohm.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54 609 Td (9.2 Non-conductive or lined pipe) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 587 Td (On plastic pipe \(PVC, PE, PP, GRP\) and on metallic pipe with an internal lining \(rubber, PTFE,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 574 Td (epoxy or cement\), grounding rings are mandatory on both sides of the meter. Grounding rings are) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 561 Td (fitted between the meter flange and the gasket on each side, and each ring is bonded to the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 548 Td (meter grounding lug.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 527 Td (Meter size | Grounding ring part number \(316L\) | Grounding ring part number \(Hastelloy C-276\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 515 Td (DN25 | LF-GR-025-P | LF-GR-025-HC) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 503 Td (DN40 | LF-GR-040-P | LF-GR-040-HC) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 491 Td (DN50 | LF-GR-050-P | LF-GR-050-HC) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 479 Td (DN65 | LF-GR-065-P | LF-GR-065-HC) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 467 Td (DN80 | LF-GR-080-P | LF-GR-080-HC) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 455 Td (DN100 | LF-GR-100-P | LF-GR-100-HC) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 443 Td (DN125 | LF-GR-125-P | LF-GR-125-HC) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 431 Td (DN150 | LF-GR-150-P | LF-GR-150-HC) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 409 Td (Grounding rings add 3 mm to the installed length per side; allow for a total of 6 mm when) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 396 Td (setting the flange gap. Use grounding ring material that matches or exceeds the corrosion) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 383 Td (resistance of the meter wetted parts.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54 360 Td (9.3 Cathodically protected pipelines) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 338 Td (On pipelines with impressed-current cathodic protection, the meter must be electrically) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 325 Td (isolated from the pipe with an insulating flange kit, and the grounding rings are bonded to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 312 Td (each other but not to the pipe. Consult Meridian application engineering before installing on a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 299 Td (cathodically protected line.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 277 Td (A missing or broken ground connection typically shows up as intermittent L-204 low signal) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 264 Td (quality warnings and a noisy flow reading at low velocities.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 239 Td (10. HART commissioning) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 217 Td (The LF-60P supports HART 7 on the 4-20 mA output \(terminals 3 and 4\). The HART device revision) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 204 Td (with firmware 1.9.0 is device revision 3. Use the DD or DTM for device revision 3; older DD) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 191 Td (files for device revision 2 will connect but will not show the pressure variables.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54 168 Td (10.1 Loop requirements) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 146 Td (- A loop resistance of at least 250 ohm is required for HART communication. With a lower) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 133 Td (   resistance, the handheld or asset management system will report no response and the meter) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 120 Td (   may raise L-222.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 107 Td (- The maximum loop resistance in passive mode is \(supply voltage - 12 V\) / 0.022 A; with a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 94 Td (   24 V loop supply this is 545 ohm.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 81 Td (- In active mode, the meter sources the loop current and the maximum load is 600 ohm.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54 67 Td (10.2 Setting the HART parameters on the local display) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
